flowchart LR
    UI[Client Apps<br/>Web / Mobile] --> API[API Gateway Layer<br/>Express on Bun]

    API --> AUTH[Authentication & Authorization<br/>JWT + RBAC]
    API --> FEED[Content & Community Module<br/>Posts, Comments, Reactions]
    API --> MSG[Messaging Module<br/>1-to-1 Conversations]
    API --> GUIDE[AI Guidance Module<br/>Session-aware Oracle]
    API --> RTC[Realtime Module<br/>Socket.IO Presence + Events]

    AUTH --> DB[(PostgreSQL via Prisma)]
    FEED --> DB
    MSG --> DB
    GUIDE --> DB
    RTC --> DB

    GUIDE <--> LLM[External Gemini API]

    AUTH --> EH[Shared Security & Error Layer<br/>Validation, Guards, Exception Handling]
    FEED --> EH
    MSG --> EH
    GUIDE --> EH
    RTC --> EH
